<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY'S BUX INDEX ENDS OFFICIALLY AT 6,018.11 PTS.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY'S BUX INDEX ENDS OFFICIALLY AT 6,018.11 PTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index ended officially at 6,018.11 points, up 88.96 points, a new record high. The official figures are unchanged from the preliminary ones. Spot share turnover totalled 3.12 billion forints.</p>
<p>BUX futures settled higher for all maturities, firming by between 61 and 135 points.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
